<div id="snackbar-dialog-overview">
  <component-banner-img/>

  <p>
    A snackbar is a non-modal dialog that appears in response to a lightweight
    user action. It dissapears automatically after a minimum of 6 seconds.
  </p>
  <p>
    The display of the snackbar should be toggled using the${" "}
    <code>hidden</code>
    ${" "}property. Please refer to the${" "}
    <a href="guides/animation/#dialog-transitions">
      Dialog Transitions
    </a>
    ${" "}section for information on how to correctly trigger a CSS transition
    from a hidden state.
  </p>
</div>
